  "story": {
    "title": "No Smiles Today",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Shanti and Arun were good friends. They had so much fun together. They shared secrets in class. They ran races on the way home. She was always cheerful.",
      "One day, Shanti came into the classroom slowly. Her head was bent. She looked sad. “Did someone scold you?” asked Arun. Shanti shook her head. She sat down and did not look up. She did not answer ‘Present!’ when Sona Miss called her name. Sona Miss called again, louder this time, “Shanti Kumar!” Shanti raised her hand.",
      "“Do you have a sore throat?” her teacher asked her. Shanti shook her head. Her cheeks were red and it looked like she had a fever. “Are you feeling okay?” Sona Miss asked. Shanti nodded, still not daring to look up.",
      "“Why does Shanti look so sad?” “Is your little brother okay?” “Is your puppy okay?” “Is your grandmother okay?” Shanti kept nodding her head to each of her friends. But she did not look up.",
      "Arun wanted to make her smile. He had an idea! He took out something from his bag. As he ran to show it to Shanti, it slipped out of his hands. Shanti saw something flying towards her and she grabbed it.",
      "It was a BIG, green, rubber frog! Shanti's eyes flew open. Then she opened her mouth to laugh. THEN Arun and her friends saw why she had not smiled or talked all day! Four of her front teeth had gone missing!"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Shanti and Arun were good friends.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Shanti và Arun là bạn tốt của nhau."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They had so much fun together.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hai bạn chơi với nhau rất vui."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They shared secrets in class.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hai bạn chia sẻ bí mật trong lớp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They ran races on the way home.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hai bạn chạy đua trên đường về nhà."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She was always cheerful.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé luôn vui vẻ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "One day, Shanti came into the classroom slowly.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một ngày nọ, Shanti đi vào lớp học thật chậm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Her head was bent.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đầu cô bé cúi gằm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She looked sad.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé trông buồn bã."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Did someone scold you?” asked Arun.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Có ai mắng cậu à?” Arun hỏi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Shanti shook her head.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Shanti lắc đầu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She sat down and did not look up.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé ngồi xuống và không ngẩng mặt lên."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She did not answer ‘Present!’ when Sona Miss called her name.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô bé không trả lời ‘Có mặt!’ khi cô Sona gọi tên."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Sona Miss called again, louder this time, “Shanti Kumar!” Shanti raised her hand.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cô Sona gọi lại, lần này to hơn, “Shanti Kumar!” Shanti giơ tay lên."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Do you have a sore throat?” her teacher asked her.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Con bị đau họng à?” cô giáo hỏi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Shanti shook her head.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Shanti lắc đầu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Her cheeks were red and it looked like she had a fever.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Má cô bé đỏ ửng và trông như cô bé bị sốt."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Are you feeling okay?” Sona Miss asked.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Con có ổn không?” cô Sona hỏi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Shanti nodded, still not daring to look up.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Shanti gật đầu, vẫn không dám ngẩng mặt lên."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "“Why does Shanti look so sad?” “Is your little brother okay?” “Is your puppy okay?” “Is your grandmother okay?” Shanti kept nodding her head to each of her friends.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "“Sao Shanti trông buồn thế?” “Em trai cậu có sao không?” “Cún con của cậu có sao không?” “Bà của cậu có sao không?” Shanti cứ gật đầu với từng người bạn của mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But she did not look up.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng cô bé không ngẩng mặt lên."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Arun wanted to make her smile.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Arun muốn làm cho cô bé cười."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He had an idea!",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu bé có một ý tưởng!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He took out something from his bag.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cậu lấy một thứ gì đó từ trong cặp ra."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "As he ran to show it to Shanti, it slipped out of his hands.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi cậu chạy đến khoe với Shanti, nó tuột khỏi tay cậu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Shanti saw something flying towards her and she grabbed it.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_024.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Shanti thấy một thứ gì đó bay về phía mình và cô bé tóm lấy nó."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It was a BIG, green, rubber frog!",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_025.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đó là một con ếch cao su LỚN, màu xanh lá cây!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Shanti's eyes flew open.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_026.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mắt Shanti mở to."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Then she opened her mouth to laugh.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_027.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Rồi cô bé mở miệng ra cười."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "THEN Arun and her friends saw why she had not smiled or talked all day!",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_028.mp3",
        "text_vi": "KHI ĐÓ Arun và các bạn mới hiểu vì sao cô bé không cười hay nói chuyện cả ngày!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Four of her front teeth had gone missing!",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_122/s_029.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bốn chiếc răng cửa của cô bé đã bị rụng mất!"
      }
    ]
  },
